Inclusion Criteria:

* confirmed genetic diagnosis of GSD Ia or Ib;
* age \>18 years;
* routine CGM use;
* habitual raw cornstarch consumption.

Exclusion Criteria:

* psychiatric disorders;
* pregnancy, celiac disease;
* dialysis treatment;
* nocturnal enteral feeding;
* severe acute or chronic illnesses.
